      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3MD multi-person swap keyframes\n\n**1. Keyframe Export** (left group)\n- Drop the source video into *Source video*, the new people into *Picture 1/2/3*.\n- *mapping*: leave empty - picture 1 goes to the first person who appears, picture 2 to the next ... (together: left to right). Once given, a person keeps his picture; later people stay themselves. *People* shows the cast; `图1换3号` / `picture 1 -> 3` picks by its numbers.\n- *descriptions*: one line per picture, head to toe (also what the picture does not show).\n- Run. The package is in output/H3MD_keyframes/<name>_keyframe_export_<date>_<no>.zip. Give it to the AI (with the H3MD keyframe skill, or the README inside the package).\n\n**2. Keyframe Import** (right group) - bypass the left group (Ctrl+B)\n- *Import package*: pick the AI's answer (<name>_keyframe_import_<date>_<no>.h3kf or .json).\n- Run: about 25 s per keyframe. Check *Compare* (original | new).\n- A keyframe is clearly wrong: tell the AI which one and what is wrong, import its new answer, click that keyframe on *Redo* and run - only that one is made again.\n- The plan (<name>_multiswap_plan_<date>_<no>.zip) goes to the Director: Import plan."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    }
